+        // [Seeds][L25] item 7 — copyin probe liveness notes (agent-Q).
+        //
+        // Why this exists (l25-prep/agent-F-crash-forensics.md): the l24 diagnostic
+        // vocabulary is init-only; nothing observed the copyin machinery after
